Response:
{% comment %} Every date and time is read in the office's time zone. {% endcomment %}
{% assign tz = "America/New_York" %}
{% assign today = "now" | date: "%Y-%m-%d", tz %}
{% assign monthday = "now" | date: "%m-%d", tz %}
{% assign weekday = "now" | date: "%u", tz | plus: 0 %}
{% assign time = "now" | date: "%H%M", tz | plus: 0 %}

{% comment %} Holidays on the same date every year {% endcomment %}
{% case monthday %}
  {% when "01-01" %}{% assign holiday = "New Year's Day" %}
  {% when "07-04" %}{% assign holiday = "Independence Day" %}
  {% when "12-25" %}{% assign holiday = "Christmas Day" %}
{% endcase %}

{% comment %} Holidays that move: list each year's date {% endcomment %}
{% case today %}
  {% when "2026-05-25", "2027-05-31" %}{% assign holiday = "Memorial Day" %}
  {% when "2026-07-03" %}{% assign holiday = "Independence Day" %}
  {% when "2026-09-07", "2027-09-06" %}{% assign holiday = "Labor Day" %}
  {% when "2026-11-26", "2027-11-25" %}{% assign holiday = "Thanksgiving" %}
{% endcase %}

{% comment %} Opening hours as HHMM; Christmas Eve closes at noon {% endcomment %}
{% assign opens = 900 %}
{% assign closes = 1700 %}
{% if monthday == "12-24" %}{% assign closes = 1200 %}{% endif %}

Thank you for calling Dunder Mifflin Paper Company, Scranton branch.

{% if holiday %}
  Our office is closed today for {{ holiday }}. We will reopen on the next business day at 9 a.m. Eastern.


{% elsif weekday >= 6 %}
  Our office is closed for the weekend. Even Dwight has gone home to the beet farm. Our hours are 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. Eastern, Monday through Friday.


{% elsif time < opens or time >= closes %}
  Our office is closed. Our hours are 9 a.m. to 5 p.m. Eastern, Monday through Friday. Dwight Schrute, Assistant to the Regional Manager, asks that you do not call him at home.


{% else %}
  Please hold while we connect you to reception.

    +15705550100

  Thank you for calling Dunder Mifflin. Goodbye.

{% endif %}
